"THE KERNEL`S AGREEMENT WITH TODAY`S LAMBDA (loaded beside arest; the kernel`s forms are arest`s). <store> to the fact types of the kernel`s P whose rows are not, as a set, what today`s system:pop_rows reads over today`s booted store; ka:n the count of each kind.",
