"The heads allowed to differ, each named: the three read through Object Type Instance is instance of Object Type, whose rows the kernel files under every type whose role an instance fills, as THE ROWS THE KERNEL HOLDS BEYOND TODAY`S above says.",
DEF("ka:rp_allowed", K(S3(A("ObjectTypeInstanceIsProperlyOfObjectType"), A("ObjectTypeInstanceIsMostSpecificallyOfObjectType"), A("ObjectTypeHasWorldAssumption")))),
